    "collapsible_content_tVjpnf": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_TpLzKh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are Partner Perks? And how do I sign up?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Partner Perks is our loyalty program that rewards you for shopping with us! It's FREE and easy to join! Your can sign up by creating an account - all we need is your name and email address. If you already have a Rustic Strength Wholesale account, simply login and click \"<a href=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-home\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-home\">Enroll Now</a>\" from your dashboard.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HFe8FR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Having trouble signing in after creating your account?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>You may need to activate your account. Email us at support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com to get an account activation email/link.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xMkyHi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I am already a Wholesale Partner, do I need a separate login for Rewards?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>No, you will login to your account normally. You can click on the Rewards button at the lower right-hand corner of the screen to view your rewards, ways to earn and ways to redeem.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UQpEGr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is your login form or password not submitting?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Our website requires your browser to allow cookies in order to login. If you are unable to login even with the right username and password, you likely have cookies disabled on your browser. If you are using a browser that automatically blocks cookies (ex. DuckDuckGo), please use a standard browser and try again.</p><p>* In Chome, go to Preferences&gt;Privacy and Security&gt; change to \"Allow all Cookies\"</p><p>* In Safari, go to Preferences&gt; Privacy&gt; be sure to uncheck \"Block all Cookies\"</p><p>* On an iPhone, go to Settings&gt; Safari &gt; untoggle \"Block all Cookies\"</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7xW7jb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I've made purchases using different email addresses and have earned points on both, can I combine accounts?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Please email support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com to have them merge your accounts. This is non-reversable. We recommend using a single login email each time you order to avoid loss of points and account information.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
