    "collapsible_content_mGLYtF": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_nnx7z9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I know how many points I have? Where can I see my points in my account?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Your total points will be shown at the top of your account page, above your order history. </p><p>You can also view your Points balance by clicking on the <a href=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-home\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-home\">Rewards Button</a> at the lower right-hand corner of our website.</p><p>You must be logged in to see your points balance. </p><p>If your balance is not displaying properly, be sure you are using a browser that allows cookies and that your settings allow cookies. If you have a popup blocker turned on, this can also cause points not to display.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tU9BhD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I earn points + how do points for dollars spent work?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Depending on the tier you're in, you'll earn at least 1 point for each dollar spent or more. </p><p>Copper Tier - $1 = 1 Point</p><p>Bronze Tier - $1 = 2 Points</p><p>Silver Tier - $1 = 3 Points</p><p>Gold Tier - $1 = 4 Points</p><p>Platinum Tier - $1 = 5 Points</p><p>Diamond Tier - $1 = 6 Points</p><p>Titanium Tier - $1 = 7 Points</p><p>We will also have special Points Days where your points earnings can double, triple or more.</p><p>Points are awarded on the subtotal of the order (after discounts & gift cards, and before taxes & shipping).</p><p>Points can also be earned in a number of other ways, including sending in your Close the Loop containers and celebrating our Partnership Anniversary. You can always check out the <a href=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-points-activity-rules\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-points-activity-rules\">Rewards Page</a> for all the ways to earn!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FWJqFx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many points do I need to redeem for rewards or to make a purchase? And do points expire?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>100 Points = $1</p><p>You may apply points in multiples of 100 to any order. Or you may redeem them for Gifts, by choosing your Gift from the Points Redemption page.</p><p>All unredeemed points will expire on a rolling basis for customers who have not engaged in points activity for 6 months (180 days) or more. <strong>Put simply, your points won't expire if you continue to earn points within 6 month periods.</strong> Points are earned through placing orders or our <a href=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-points-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrengthwholesale.com/pages/wholesale-partner-perks/#smile-points-products\">other ways to earn</a>.</p><p>Rewards Members will be notified by email, of points expiring 60 days and again, 3 days before they expire.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tnVW6X": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why didn't I earn points on my purchase?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Points will be applied to your account after your order is fulfilled. </p><p>If your order has been delivered and you do not see your points, check that you shopped using the same email and login that you use for your Points account. If you find that you have more than one account, we can merge them for you.</p><p>Please reach out to (support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com)</p><p>Be sure to use the same email address when shopping.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tkUFgh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I left a review on a product I purchased, why didn't I earn points?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>In order to earn points for a review it must be a verified review, meaning the review must be submitted via the email you receive from customercare@rusticstrength.com. A review request email will be sent to the email address used to place the order 14 days after the order is placed, if you don't receive it within 21 days after your order is fulfilled, please reach out to our team and we will be able to help!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ePEagi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Its our Partnership Anniversary and I didn't get my reward.",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Anniversary points will not appear in your account until 30 days after you submit the date as a fraud prevention measure. If you do not see the points 30 days later, please contact us at support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xPYjwD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens to my points if I return a product or an order is cancelled?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Any product that is returned or any order that is cancelled will reverse or decrease the points you received from that purchase. If you moved up a tier on that order, your tier will also be adjusted accordingly.</p><p>If an order is placed using Perks Points and then you complete a return, you forfeit points used.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_aLMF6a": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I earned points but I don't know how to redeem them towards my purchase. How do I checkout using Points?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Before or during checkout be sure to log in so you're able to choose your reward. Ready to redeem points? You have two options for points redemption:</p><p>Option 1: From the Rewards Redemption page, you can choose the gifts or coupons that you would like to purchase with points. Simply add them to your cart.</p><p>Option 2: From your shopping cart, click on the \"Redeem Points\" button and enter the number of points you would like to apply toward your order.</p><p><em>Please note - if you leave the screen or if you are unable to use points on your purchase, they will be issued to you in an email as a coupon. The system is unable to return the points to your points balance automatically.  If you would like to return your points to the total balance, please contact Customer Care.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QKnYME": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I redeemed points for a coupon but it didn't apply to my order.",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>If you redeemed points for a coupon but didn't use the coupon code at checkout, your code is still valid and can be redeemed at a later date. You will receive an email with the code in case you don't complete your purchase immediately after redeeming.</p><p>To use, you will need to enter the coupon code at checkout.</p><p>Can't find the email? Let us know and we will be happy to resend it to you. (support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
