    "collapsible_content_MpjPTp": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_wDgygw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do Tiers work?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We have 7 Tiers: Copper, Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond and Titanium. When you sign up for the program, you are automatically in the Bronze Tier just for signing up! Starting that date you will start accruing points immediately! Tier status is calculated by <strong>Calendar Year</strong>. When you reach a certain Tier, you will remain there (or move up if your spending increases you to the next Tier), for the remainder of the year <strong>and for the next year.</strong></p><p>Our Tiers are based on the amount of money spent and each new Tier has new benefits to unlock!</p><ul><li>Copper - $0 - $999 (active enrollment is required to receive benefits)</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Bronze - $1,000 - $4,999</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Silver - $5,000 - $9,999</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Gold - $10,000 - $49,999</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Platinum - $50,000 - $99,999</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Diamond - $100,000 - 249,999</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>Titanium - $250,000 +</li></ul><p>Redeeming your points will not affect your Tier status.</p>",
            "page": "rewards-program-tier-advancing-diagram"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DDU7Y4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do Tiers expire or reset?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Tier status is based on a 12 month calendar period.</p><p>For example, if you spent enough to reach the Diamond tier in November of 2025, you will enjoy the benefits of Diamond tier status for the rest of 2025 and all of 2026.</p><p>Then, during the calendar year of 2026, you will have to spend enough to re-qualify for the Diamond tier for 2027. If you do not, the tier status will be recalculated based on the money that you <em>did</em> spend in that 2026 calendar year. </p><p><em>Remember, the amount you spend on our products (after discounts) qualifies you for tiers. This does not include money spent on taxes or shipping.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wwxQ6W": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I placed a large order that took me from the Silver Tier directly to the Platinum Tier, why didn't I receive my Gold Tier rewards?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>You will only receive the rewards for the Tier that you have entered. Because you jumped over the Gold Tier and did not enter it, you will not receive the entry rewards for that Tier. You will only receive the Platinum Tier entry reward(s).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
