        "collapsible_row_99BiYD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rewards Program Terms + Conditions",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Welcome to the Rustic Strength Partner Perks Rewards Program!</strong></p><p>This Program allows businesses who partner with Rustic Strength (\"Partner\", \"you\", or \"your\") to earn points for qualifying purchases made on our website (www.rusticstrengthwholesale.com).<br/>These points can then be redeemed for various rewards and benefits offered by<br/>Rustic Strength.</p><p><strong>1. Membership</strong></p><p><strong>Free to Join:</strong> There is no fee to join the Program.</p><p><strong>Eligibility: </strong>To be eligible, you must be a registered business entity with a valid business address.</p><p><strong>Enrollment: </strong> To enroll, visit RusticStrengthWholesale.com and click the “Join Now”     button.</p><p><strong>Account Information:</strong> You are responsible for maintaining the accuracy and completeness of the information associated with your account. You can    access and update your account information by logging into your account.</p><p><strong>Canceling Membership:</strong> You may cancel your membership at any time by emailing us at support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com Upon cancellation, any unused points in your account will be forfeited.</p><p><strong>2. Earning Points</strong></p><p><strong>Qualifying Purchases:</strong> Points can only be earned on qualifying purchases made on<br/>     www.rusticstrengthwholesale.com. Qualifying purchases may include any products designated by Rustic Strength. Shipping fees and taxes are not eligible for points.</p><p><strong>Earning Rate:</strong> The rate at which you earn points will be based on your tier level within the Program. Tier levels and their corresponding earning    rates will be clearly outlined on the Program website.</p><p><strong>Glass (0 – 999 points) - </strong>$1 = 1 point</p><p><strong>Bronze (1,000 – 4,999 points) -</strong> $1 = 2 points</p><p><strong>Silver (5,000 – 9,999 points) - </strong>$1 = 3 points</p><p><strong>Gold (10,000 –</strong> <strong>49,999 points) - </strong>$1 = 4 points</p><p><strong>Platinum (50,000 – 99,999 points) - </strong>$1 – 5 points</p><p><strong>Diamond (100,000 –</strong> <strong>249,999 points) - </strong>$1 = 6 points</p><p><strong>Titanium (250,000 + ) -</strong> $1 = 7 points</p><p><strong>Point Tracking:</strong> Points are typically added to your account within 24 hours of your order being <em><strong>shipped</strong></em>. You can track your points balance by logging into your account.</p><p><strong>3. Redeeming Points</strong></p><p><strong>Redemption Options:</strong> You can redeem your points for various rewards and benefits offered by Rustic Strength, such as discounts on future purchases,      exclusive merchandise, or free shipping. Rewards will change periodically.<br/>     Available redemption options and their point requirements will be displayed on the Program website.</p><p><strong>Redemption Process:</strong> To redeem points, log into your account and visit the   redemption section. Select the desired reward and follow the instructions for redemption.</p><p><strong>Restrictions: </strong>Points can only be redeemed for authorized rewards. Points cannot be redeemed for cash or gift cards. Points have no cash value.</p><p><strong>4. General Terms</strong></p><p><strong>Acceptance: </strong>By participating in the Program, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions.</p><p><strong>Changes to the Program:</strong> Rustic Strength reserves the right to modify or change the Program, including the point earning rate, redemption options, and tier structure, at any time without prior notice.</p><p><strong>Termination: </strong> Rustic Strength reserves the right to suspend or terminate your membership and/or the Program at any time for any reason.</p><p><strong>Inactive Accounts:</strong> If your account is inactive for a period of 6 months (180 days) your points may be forfeited.</p><p><strong>Promotional Offers:</strong> Rustic Strength may offer promotional point bonuses or other benefits from time to time. These promotions will have specific terms and conditions that will be communicated at the time of the offer.</p><p><strong>Governing Law:</strong> These Terms & Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States and the State of Missouri.</p><p><strong>5. Additional Information</strong></p><p>For more information about the Rustic Strength Partner Perks<br/>Rewards Program, please visit our website or contact us at support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
